WEBVTT

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.030
That's the fifth one.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.860
Well done, Akane.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.990
We did it, girls...

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.450
Sis...

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.510
Six more...

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:16.740
Good work last night.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.410
I've called you all here for a different matter though.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.120
It's about the upcoming exams.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:26.340
Isshiki!

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.170
Sleepy?

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:31.170
Well, we <i>were</i> up late last night.

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:32.880
I'm fine, no worries!

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.510
I'm sorry, Ms. Mizuha.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:39.470
Fine? You think it's <i>fine</i> to sleep through morning classes?

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.390
I'm sorry...

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:48.360
You've been neglecting your homework and your test results are subpar.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.940
I'm sorry...

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:52.320
That's true, but you can't blame her for it!

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:55.120
She works part-time every day,

00:02:55.780 --> 00:03:00.540
and she has no time to study if an Alone shows up late like last night!

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.080
That's true.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.920
What I want to talk about is related to that as well.

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:11.050
The teachers are quite strict about grades.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:14.140
If you score poorly on the upcoming exams,

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:16.140
you'll be banned from working part-time,

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:20.180
and you'll have to stay for extra classes after school every day until the next round of testing.

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.930
What? No way!

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:26.560
It would also adversely affect the operations of the Vividteam.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:32.450
Worst case scenario, we could pull some strings in the military to alter your grades.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:33.950
Cheating isn't right!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.580
Will you do better then?

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:42.870
Ms. Mizuha! We'll work something out!

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:44.120
What exactly?

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.340
Um...

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:48.500
Let's study together at Akane's place!

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:51.300
We can help her study for the exams!

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:52.630
Good idea.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:54.550
You're gonna help me?

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:57.350
Hurray! Thanks!

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.640
That sounds reassuring.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:01.930
You girls make a good team.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:02.850
Do your best.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.190
Yes ma'am!

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:08.070
See you on Saturday!

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:11.900
She's only free on Saturdays...

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:14.490
Even today, she's working after school.

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:16.660
She really does have no time.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:21.000
Her grades were great back in elementary school though.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.080
She'll be fine if we help her!

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.380
Yeah, I guess.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:31.760
Also, can I invite someone else to our study group?

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:32.760
Huh?

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.180
Sounds like a good idea.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:40.100
Yeah, let's do that!

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:54.110
There you are.

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:58.450
Here.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:02.960
Does it taste good?

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:05.290
I'm glad to hear.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.340
That tickles!

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:12.380
Kuroki!

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:15.300
What?

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:18.470
Sorry! Did I surprise you?

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:19.180
What do you want?

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:21.100
Um...

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:24.270
Would you happen to be free this Saturday?

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:26.900
What if I was?

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:28.780
Wanna study together?

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.190
Huh?

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:32.650
Exams are coming up.

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:37.080
That's why we've decided to study at Akane's place this Saturday.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.700
I was wondering if you'd like to join us.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:46.040
No chance. I have other things to do.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.710
Kuroki!

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.720
<i>What was that about?</i>

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:00.850
Oh, sorry! Did I surprise you?

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:03.640
That reminds me, Kuroki...

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:06.150
Wanna tag along...

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.360
with us next Saturday?

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.360
We're holding a study session at Akane's.

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:15.780
If you'd like, you should join us.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:20.250
No chance. I'm busy that day.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.000
I see... That's too bad.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:26.250
But if your plans change, let us know!

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.510
Hey, you.

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:37.560
You free on Saturday?

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.640
We're having a stu—

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:44.940
I'm busy! Study by yourselves!

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:49.440
She's such a weirdo.

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:52.450
But an interesting one.

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:01.000
Hey, Piisuke.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:04.580
Why can't they just leave me alone?

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:08.880
I don't even want to go to school anymore...

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:14.430
<i>I cannot allow that.</i>

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:21.310
<i>Human interference is not allowed.</i>

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:24.770
<i>However, you must still attend school every day.</i>

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.570
<i>That was our first agreement.</i>

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:30.150
But why?

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:34.110
If the Alones destroy the Manifestor Engine, it'll be all over anyway,

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:37.040
so what's the point of going to school?

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.870
<i>Because </i>they<i> said so.</i>

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:46.170
<i>You are in no position to argue.</i>

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:53.220
<i>If it is required for the destruction of the Manifestor Engine, certain exceptions might be made.</i>

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:59.310
<i>Otherwise, you must obey our agreement.</i>

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.600
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:03.640
I do...

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:15.700
<i>In the end, my only choice is to destroy the Manifestor Engine as soon as possible.</i>

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:20.200
<i>I can't keep relying on the Alones.</i>

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.420
<i>If only I knew more about its weaknesses...</i>

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:26.340
What's this?

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:32.590
<i>"The designer of the Manifestor Engine, Dr. Isshiki Kenjirou..."</i>

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.260
<i>"...and his granddaughter,</i>

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:39.220
Isshiki Akane."

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:47.270
Akane!

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.610
Yeah!

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:54.030
Come in!

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:55.660
I've been waiting for you!

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:58.410
Oh, all three of you are here! You came together!

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.040
Wrong!

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:06.040
Rei!

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:09.300
Excuse me...

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:13.010
Where's Dr. Isshiki?

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:16.430
At Blue Island. He said he might have to stay there again.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:20.310
Himawari, we're not here to make small talk!

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:24.350
By the way, Akane. Where's Momo?

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:25.560
Here!

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:27.900
Welcome!

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.070
An apron!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:36.830
We've made notes covering all the important topics for every subject!

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.580
You should be fine with these!

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.450
Whoa! Thanks!

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:45.380
Please take care of my senseless sister!

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.340
I've got some shopping to do. Excuse me!

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:50.670
So cute...

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:53.180
She's reliable, unlike her sister.

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:58.350
What's wrong, Rei?

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:01.640
It's nothing...

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:03.480
Let's get started then!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.860
What's your best subject, Rei?

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:11.400
Huh? Nothing in particular...

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.110
Are you good at everything then?

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:15.950
Her grades are on par with Wakaba's.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:20.120
It's so obvious which subjects you like and which ones you don't!

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:23.330
You should at least make the national average for the ones you don't like.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:24.540
That'd be boring.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.670
Huh? What's more interesting than literature?

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.840
What about you, Kuroki?

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:30.760
What do you like?

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:38.220
I prefer studying plants and animals over literature... I guess.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:41.480
Oh yeah! You're friends with the seagulls!

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:43.480
Got any pets?

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:48.900
May I go to the restroom?

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:52.320
Oh, sure. It's to your left if you go out that door.

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:57.990
<i>I'm not here to play around.</i>

00:10:57.990 --> 00:10:59.870
<i>What am I even doing?</i>

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.960
<i>Judging from the building's structure,</i>

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:10.380
<i>Dr. Isshiki's lab is probably on the far right.</i>

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:14.340
What's this?

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.770
What happened here?

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:26.520
<i>So if you do this, the </i>x<i> will disappear, see?</i>

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.020
<i>Oh, I got it!</i>

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.370
<i>Dr. Isshiki Kenjirou...</i>

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:39.290
<i>Is this another one of his inventions?</i>

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.770
Natural Harmony School... Paralyzer Punch.

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:00.850
I'm sowwy!

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:07.900
What happened to me?

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:10.740
You seemed to have slipped in the restroom and passed out.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:22.580
Something wrong?

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:26.380
It's... nothing...

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:32.630
Good, good, good!

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:35.760
You got 19 out of 20 right!

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:37.850
See, you can do it if you try!

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.180
Good job, Akane!

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:48.020
You're probably hungry after all that studying.

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:50.230
Then let's make something to eat!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.030
Momo!

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:53.700
I'm back!

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:57.620
I bought a lot, so you all should eat up too!

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:00.750
Akane, could you get some veggies from the garden?

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:03.000
Right away!

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:36.740
Request emergency aid from the central command of the Allied Defense Force!

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.490
Here it comes!

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:43.250
Wow, it's so well-kept!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:46.170
Do you care for it, Akane?

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:48.000
Yeah, together with Momo.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:51.050
The cucumbers have thorns.

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:53.340
What are you doing, Akane?

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:08.730
Delicious!

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:14.160
It's good.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.450
Right?

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:16.240
Hurray!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.450
She's really weird, isn't she?

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:20.330
Isshiki, that is.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.410
Did she spark your interest?

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:22.660
Huh?

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:29.800
She always says that people who want to be friends share a certain vivid feeling.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:34.720
I didn't really get it at first,

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.930
but since we've met Wakaba and Himawari,

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:41.930
I think I'm coming to understand that "vivid" feeling a little better.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:47.440
She's the force that brought us all together.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:52.190
She's our center.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:58.950
It tastes like rainbows.

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:03.960
Aoi, heads up!

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:07.960
Girls, you've got mayo all over your faces!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.260
Lickity-lickity-lick!

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:18.100
You should try one too, Rei!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.600
I'm sure you'll love it!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:23.600
There's another one stuck to it.

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.730
They're friends!

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.820
That's really lucky! Something good will happen to you soon.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.440
Something good?

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:34.740
Yeah. Maybe your wish will come true.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:35.780
My wish?

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.370
My wish...

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.090
Rei! You mustn't waste food!

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:59.100
I just remembered I had something to do.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.600
Excuse me.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:02.060
Rei...

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:02.810
Kuroki!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:03.940
Rei?

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:18.030
<i>Why am I hanging out with them?</i>

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.250
<i>I only have a single wish.</i>

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:25.500
<i>It's my reason to live on.</i>

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:33.090
<i>It is your turn, Rei.</i>

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:39.790
It's an electromagnetic pulse attack.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:44.620
They inflict damage to the semiconductors and circuits of electric devices

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:49.500
by overloading their antennas and cables with a strong surge current.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:53.800
To put it simply, they use strong shockwaves to destroy electronic devices.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:54.720
Look at this.

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.470
This is after the Alone passed.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.220
It's pitch black!

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:05.020
It's making a beeline to Blue Island.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:07.560
If things continue like this,

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:10.650
the heart of Japan will be without power.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.360
We can't even begin to predict the damage.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:16.910
Are you listening well?

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:19.990
You must stop it here!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.450
We're counting on you!

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.370
Yeah!

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.540
Texture on!

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.450
There it is.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.910
We must win!

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.250
We still haven't had Momo's dinner!

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.720
Naked Rang!

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:24.480
Naked Impact!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.790
Naked Blade!

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:50.590
It doesn't seem strong at all.

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:53.170
Yeah, but it isn't stopping either!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.760
Akane, we have to stop it now!

00:19:57.470 --> 00:19:59.100
Don't forget that you're over a city!

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:01.430
You can't allow the debris to crash into the city!

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:04.230
Use the VividCollider to obliterate it all at once!

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:05.980
Himawari!

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:07.020
Okay!

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:08.730
Operation...

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:12.150
Vividyellow!
Vividyellow!

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:56.280
Engine critical limit reached. Output at 200%!

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:01.700
Make it!

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:06.670
Final operation!

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:22.310
You did it, Akane!

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:26.520
Now that it's over, I remembered I'm starving.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:28.610
Yeah, same here.

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:31.650
You were thinking about food all along.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:39.030
They managed to stop it.

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:43.000
It's the Vivid System I created. What else would you expect?

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:45.770
Something is weird.

00:21:45.770 --> 00:21:48.000
The Alone's signal is not disappearing.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.710
What?

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:53.260
Oh no!

00:22:01.890 --> 00:22:02.520
Watch out!

00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:08.270
Akane!

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:22.200
Akane!

00:24:03.100 --> 00:24:06.230
I hope they'll be back soon.

00:24:13.530 --> 00:24:14.740
Akane...

00:24:15.180 --> 00:24:17.000
You're still fighting...

00:24:17.450 --> 00:24:20.080
Don't worry. We won't give up yet either!

00:24:20.370 --> 00:24:22.750
Next time: Even More Colorful than Today.

00:24:23.250 --> 00:24:26.890
Akane-chan, we're with you all the way!
